  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 92b2c8003586277498a007ee213cc22b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 'Log - [unassigned 2]'
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FloppyData
  diskName: 'Log - [unassigned 2]'
  logTitle: A Small Celebration
  author: '[Captain TBD]'
  shipName: '[Unassigned]'
  dateRecorded: '[TBD]'
  logText: 'Today''s my birthday.

    I nearly forgot, actually. Only remembered
    when I checked the date on my personal calendar this morning.

    I found one
    of those little chocolate cakes they packed with the emergency rations. I''m
    fairly certain it wasn''t intended for birthdays, but I figured this was as good
    an occasion as any.

    Tasted terrible. Dry as cardboard.

    Still ate
    the whole thing.

    I spent a little while looking through some old photographs
    afterward. Mom and Dad, my brother, the house we grew up in. Strange how clearly
    I can remember the kitchen in that place. The wallpaper, the refrigerator magnets,
    that awful clock Dad insisted on keeping above the stove.

    I wonder if the
    house is still standing.

    Well, wherever they are, I hope they''re doing
    alright.

    Happy birthday to me.'
